AB  - In recent years,governments at grassroots level have made great accomplishments in propelling administration according to law,yet there are still problems as follows,as to ideology,the conception of ruling of law has enhanced but that of ruling by men still roots deep;in light of the management system of administration,the illicit activities of power exchanged for interest have not been effectively crushed while the corresponding relation between power and liability has not been established,resulting in lack of organized forces to propel administration according to law.As to the management mechanism,rules of incentive and punishment are still not adequately established so that governments at grassroots level do not give priority to administration according to law;moreover,lots of loopholes exist in the management system,tending to power abuse.The above mentions problems attribute to the facts that,the administration power is exercised subject to the perfection of market economy and the transformation of government function and it directly depends on the reform process of the management system.The supervision on administration organizations,particularly the leaders is far from perfect,resulting in their lack of positivity of administration according to law.Some legal rules of administration management are not devised rationally and fail to conform to the actual situation of our country,making it unfeasible to practice administration according to law.
