TI  - The inner mechanism of city idle land and its governance
AU  - Zhou Zhen
PY  - 2012
JO  - Urban Problems
AB  - Due to the imperfect idle land disposal and prevention system at the present,part of land resources turn into idle land with the influence of certain mechanism which increased the disorder of land market and caused the waste of resources.More serious problem is that the stainable development of our economic and society has been severely hampered.With the method of institutionalism analysis,this article comes to a conclusion on inner mechanism,realistic root and governance framework of city idle land.The political and economic cost of idle land is small,but profit huge.Under the interest margin and direct influence of government,enterprise and historical reasons,large numbers of idle land have appeared.Therefore,some measures in four aspects including changing development concept to use land intensively,making the relevant laws perfectly,improving the idle land government management and supervision system,constructing the market mechanism of idle land prevention and control should be taken.Meanwhile,with the support of related construction the idle land problem can be solved effectively.
