JO  - Chinese Journal of Population Resources and Environment
AB  - Idle land governance in development zone is the important issue to be settled to improve land saving and intensive use system in China. Taking new high-tech industry development zone of city ‘A'in north China as an example,and through field investigation and typical analysis,this paper discussed the status,causes,governance obstacles and solutions of idle land in development zone. The results show that,the area of idle land of development zone is huge,and the expropriated but not supplied land and industrial,commercial and residential land are the main parts. The idle land caused by government behaviors such as planning adjustment,land expropriated but not transferred,land use disputes and unfinished demolition,is more than the idle land caused by enterprises protracting the project or enterprise bankrupt. And lack of scientific development mechanism,stronger driving force from land finance,land price inconsistent with the land market and lower cost of breaking law are the inner causes of idle land in development zone. In general,idle land is closely related to the characteristics of development zone being administrated by the government. And idle land lead to problems of resources waste,dirty and messy environment and so on; this isn 't good for development zone construction. Idle land governance in development zone are facing actual obstacles of lacking legal basis to identify idle land inefficient investigation mechanism of idle land use and imperfect reuse mechanism. In the future,the solutions for governance idle land in development zone are innovating land supply and use mechanism to reduce the idle land sources,reforming land bank and collective construction land transfer system,establishing comprehensive examination mechanism of enterprises land use,amending the standard of idle land,establishing multi- department investigation model and public participation mechanism,improving the legal and administrative systems,increasing the cost of illegal land use,and carrying out rehabilitation system of idle arable land,establishing enterprise construction land transfer system and idle land interest dispute settlement mechanism and perfecting and promoting idle land management and reuse.
