TY  - JOUR
TI  - Conservation-Compatible Retrofit Solutions in Historic Buildings: An Integrated Approach
AU  - Alessia Buda
AU  - Ernst Jan de Place Hansen
AU  - Alexander Rieser
AU  - Emanuela Giancola
