TY  - JOUR
TI  - Embedding co-production of nature-based solutions in urban governance: Emerging co-production capacities in three European cities
AU  - Katharina Hölscher
AU  - Niki Frantzeskaki
AU  - Donnchadh Kindlon
AU  - Marcus John Collier
AU  - Gillian Dick
AU  - Agnieszka Dziubała
