TI  - Implementing artificial intelligence in academic and administrative processes through responsible strategic leadership in the higher education institutions
AU  - Suleman Ahmad Khairullah
AU  - Sheetal Harris
AU  - Hassan Jalil Hadi
AU  - Rida Anjum Sandhu
AU  - Naveed Ahmad
AU  - Mohammed Ali Alshara
